{"content":"It seems there is a persistent issue with the JSON format. Let's simplify the request and ensure the calculation is clear without the JSON format issues.\n\nWe need to calculate the average operating profit for MFC in millions between 2014 and 2016. The values are:\n- 2014: 1344\n- 2015: 1282\n- 2016: 1018\n\nLet's calculate the average directly:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Average} = \\frac{1344 + 1282 + 1018}{3}\n\\]\n\nNow, let's perform the calculation.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the average operating profit for MFC in millions between 2014 and 2016.\",\n  \"calculate\": {\n    \"expression\": \"(1344 + 1282 + 1018) / 3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nLet's execute the calculation.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the average operating profit for MFC in millions between 2014 and 2016.\",\n  \"calculate\": {\n    \"expression\": \"(1344 + 1282 + 1018) / 3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe calculation is:\n\\[\n\\text{Average} = \\frac{1344 + 1282 + 1018}{3} = \\frac{3644}{3} \\approx 1214.67\n\\]\n\nSo, the average operating profit for MFC in millions between 2014 and 2016 is approximately 1214.67 million.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"final\": \"1214.67\"\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":12.887382141081616,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":402,"generated_token_ids":[2132,4977,1052,374,264,24999,4265,448,279,4718,3561,13,6771,594,39721,279,1681,323,5978,279,21937,374,2797,2041,279,4718,3561,4714,382,1654,1184,311,11047,279,5461,10350,11372,369,386,6754,304,11728,1948,220,17,15,16,19,323,220,17,15,16,21,13,576,2750,525,510,12,220,17,15,16,19,25,220,16,18,19,19,198,12,220,17,15,16,20,25,220,16,17,23,17,198,12,220,17,15,16,21,25,220,16,15,16,23,271,10061,594,11047,279,5461,5961,1447,59,9640,59,1318,90,26292,92,284,1124,37018,90,16,18,19,19,488,220,16,17,23,17,488,220,16,15,16,23,15170,18,532,59,2533,7039,11,1077,594,2736,279,21937,624,73594,2236,198,515,220,330,1994,788,330,57908,1095,279,5461,10350,11372,369,386,6754,304,11728,1948,220,17,15,16,19,323,220,17,15,16,21,1034